cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use canli-research-mcp, please cite the software and its author."
title: "canli-research-mcp: an open quantitative research record as an MCP server"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Canli"
    given-names: "Arhan"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-4138-7907"
repository-code: "https://github.com/arhancanli/canli-research-mcp"
url: "https://canlicapital.com/research"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - model context protocol
  - open research
  - multiple testing
  - quantitative finance
abstract: >-
  A Model Context Protocol server over Canli Capital's published research record: every paper and
  killed candidate, the count of hypotheses tried against a declared budget, the live
  paper-trading record, and the head of the tamper-evident chain that shows the record was not
  rewritten after publication. Each result carries the limits its source states.
